Most of haskell-reviewer is under the BSD 3-Clause License below.

The line diff is not: haskell-reviewer/src/HaskellReviewer/Core/LineDiff.hs
and haskell-reviewer/src/HaskellReviewer/Core/LineDiff/*.hs are ported
from git's xdiff and are under the GNU Lesser General Public License,
version 2.1 or (at your option) any later version. See LICENSE.LGPL-2.1
and each file's header. LineDiff/Histogram.hs comes from git's
xhistogram.c, which git took from JGit: it also carries JGit's Eclipse
Distribution License (BSD-style) notice, in its header and at the end
of this file.

